body:
‘I was detained and threatened by police’ CJP Volunteer Junaid EXCLUSIVE

@Saurabh_Unmute 

Watch Full Video on The Red Mike’s YouTube Channel. https://t.co/jftKU54auL

The Supreme Court cannot be politicised for government’s gains. Its orders cannot be weaponised to achieve those gains. A solemn guarantee was given before the nation. Those ought to be honoured. All FIRs ought to be withdrawn. If criminals roamed, police must apply for cancellation of bail in their old cases. Must also answer why they were roaming so freely in society. But government can’t use this excuse to pursue FIRs so it can later target genuine protesters. If given this leeway, the government will, of course, use it.

The youth will NOT accept this at any cost! We will stand with each and every protester who stood up for each other’s future!

@Cockroachisback

@SauravDassss @Cockroachisback Your boss Abhijeet Dipke opposed ID Check of the protestors on Jantar Mantar, so don’t try to be smart here. You will face karma.!

If you try to provoke mota bhai again, even your pawpaw Khujliwala won’t be able to save you.

Watch the space!

@LtGenDPPandey Sir. I am from Australia.
These paid groups mean nothing there... They are most likely jantar mantar kind of protestors.
Australians love Indian people (unless someone got replaced by one in their job...)

Delhi police refutes the claims circulating on social media and news reports regarding the registration of FIR against protestors at Jantar Mantar. 

The police clarified that no FIR has been registered against the protestors. The police have urged citizens not to believe or share unverified information.

@DelhiPolice

