Remember the “bajao thali” call? 
Cockroach Janta Party brought it back at Jantar Mantar — but this time as protest. CJP protestors marched through the streets banging on steel plates—a direct, satirical nod to PM Modi's Covid-era instructions to the nation.

@CJP_for_India #CockroachJantaParty #JantarMantar #PMModi #DelhiNews #CJPProtest @abhijeet_dipke #delhiprotest

quote_body:
CJP founder Abhijeet Dipke is a liar, a hypocrite, and a terrible actor. He says he is being treated like a terrorist and that this entire protest is crowd-funded, and then he goes and checks into a five-star hotel. Lol.

If that’s the case, is his five-star accommodation also being funded by the crowd? And is this what being treated like a terrorist is supposed to look like? Bro is a “good terrorist”, I guess. 

But at what point will CJP supporters realize that he is simply another face of the RSS–AAP nexus?

And also CJP supporters might say that he just went there to relieve himself, ok chalo let’s believe that for a second, but the point is that there are other places closer to the protest site. Why didn’t he go there? Does he need a five-star washroom just to freshen up? Protest site pe unhygienic washrooms hote hain, so ok, one can have a valid excuse not to use that. But why would he need a 5 star hotel washroom only? Chalo maan bhi lo, khane peene gaya hoga, aaram karne gaya hoga. Just do better than an average BJP bhakt.

@CJP_for_India 
@abhijeet_dipke

body:
Lutyens Delhi/Jantar Mantar 

Abhijeet Dipke Says He Will Serve Tea to Delhi Police

 Alleged ta vendor Was Stopped by police from serving tea to protestors 

 CJP leader Abhijeet Dipke alleged that Delhi Police stopped a young tea vendor from serving tea to protesters at Jantar Mantar. 

"Tomorrow, I will personally distribute tea to Delhi Police personnel. Selling tea is not a crime. Show a big heart. And who knows, what if a tea seller becomes Prime Minister again?" he said.

 #Delhi #JantarMantar #Protest
@abhijeet_dipke @cockroachisback
@DelhiPolice 
@CPDelhi

@PoornimaNimo If  this is true then charges of sedition should be put on her &amp; remove all these fake protestors from Jantar mantar as of now , immediately .
What are we waiting for ...
@AmitShah

@Cockroachisback Govt of India is very happy
Jantar mantar the designated protest location in Delhi is occupied by the failed cockroach protestors
No other protest is getting permission whether genuine or not

@KishlaySharma LOL 😂 
The members of CJP are mostly Modi Champions and backed by AAP

NSUI protestors are on the roads welcomed by water cannons by the govt. CJP members could not even stand the heat at Jantar Mantar. Getting blind followers in sm is different than fighting on the ground.

